Upstream notice
---------------

This repository is a fork of https://github.com/ToonSoftwareCollective/tscClock
(forked at commit af304ec, 27 December 2022), which itself builds on the
standard Toon clock app.

At the time of writing, the upstream repository publishes no license file. The
MIT grant above therefore covers only the changes and additions made in this
fork by the copyright holder named above; it cannot and does not grant rights
in the portions of the code that originate from ToonSoftwareCollective. Those
portions remain under their authors' copyright, with no license terms stated.

If you intend to redistribute this software, ask ToonSoftwareCollective to
state a license for the upstream code first. Several other repositories in
that organisation (nlalert, toonmqtt, ToonRooter) are MIT-licensed.
